WEBVTT

00:00:01.404 --> 00:00:05.074
...and the rest is all data we've
gotten from Precog division.

00:00:06.314 --> 00:00:10.304
The Children, move out! BRAVE UP!

00:00:11.084 --> 00:00:13.054
So, I'll just be going, then.

00:00:13.454 --> 00:00:14.424
God...

00:00:14.424 --> 00:00:18.024
What's with the "Brave Up" stuff?
He's not Yuuta from J-Decker...

00:00:18.024 --> 00:00:21.294
Hold on a sec! Good morning, Darling!

00:00:21.294 --> 00:00:22.424
I'm not your darling.

00:00:22.494 --> 00:00:25.054
You haven't kissed me goodbye yet!

00:00:27.404 --> 00:00:29.904
I was acting so cool, but he's the one who...

00:00:29.904 --> 00:00:33.204
Don't worry, sir. You weren't being cool at all.

00:00:34.044 --> 00:00:35.204
Just kidding.

00:00:35.204 --> 00:00:36.974
Don't go that far if you're just kidding!

00:00:37.514 --> 00:00:38.814
Minamoto?

00:00:38.814 --> 00:00:40.944
There's something I need to show you.

00:00:41.414 --> 00:00:43.384
Display pending item #666!

00:00:46.024 --> 00:00:49.474
Will The Children be angels or devils?

00:00:49.924 --> 00:00:53.564
Angel, 26%. Devil, 29%...

00:00:53.564 --> 00:00:56.294
Probability of going either way: 45%...

00:00:56.664 --> 00:01:00.694
The accuracy might have been higher
if Igo had found this, but...

00:01:01.464 --> 00:01:03.524
Is that why you took me to that sea before?

00:01:03.774 --> 00:01:07.244
What's the meaning of this?!
How could the girls be devils?!

00:01:07.244 --> 00:01:09.514
The only thing devilish about
them is how adorable they are!

00:01:09.514 --> 00:01:12.804
They grip my heart, so how?!

00:01:12.984 --> 00:01:13.344
You understand, don't you?

00:01:13.344 --> 00:01:14.284
There, there, Chief!
You understand, don't you?

00:01:14.284 --> 00:01:14.914
There, there, Chief!
The moment that graph shows a 100%
probability of them turning evil...

00:01:14.914 --> 00:01:16.454
Don't get so upset!
The moment that graph shows a 100%
probability of them turning evil...

00:01:16.454 --> 00:01:19.044
They're angels, I tell you! ANGELS!
The moment that graph shows a 100%
probability of them turning evil...

00:01:19.584 --> 00:01:20.844
You wouldn't!

00:01:21.484 --> 00:01:28.584
Tsuyoku ririshiku habataite

00:01:29.594 --> 00:01:35.464
Zettai Karen Children

00:01:37.904 --> 00:01:43.704
Anata to koushite deaeta no wa

00:01:44.044 --> 00:01:48.914
Tada ikiteiku tame nanka ja nai

00:01:50.184 --> 00:01:55.714
Chiisai na chikai wa toki wo koete

00:01:56.124 --> 00:02:00.714
Mirai wo kanarazu kaeru yo

00:02:01.324 --> 00:02:04.234
Limiter (changing myself)

00:02:04.234 --> 00:02:07.354
Tokihaneteba (changing yourself)

00:02:07.504 --> 00:02:13.234
Hotobashiru tenshi no shining

00:02:14.674 --> 00:02:17.244
Sekai wo sukuu "tsubasa"

00:02:17.244 --> 00:02:20.074
Ima watashi ga eranda michi

00:02:20.314 --> 00:02:26.484
Yume wo tsukamitai dakedo (Tomaranai)

00:02:26.624 --> 00:02:29.424
Ataerareta chikara ga

00:02:29.424 --> 00:02:32.054
Sora e karitateru yo

00:02:32.054 --> 00:02:37.794
Tsuyoku ririshiku habataite

00:02:38.134 --> 00:02:43.664
Zettai karen my wings

00:02:57.714 --> 00:02:59.424
Great... Another mission?

00:02:59.424 --> 00:03:00.684
30th sense: "Enemies in the Same Boat!
Safecracking is Systematic"
Great... Another mission?

00:03:00.684 --> 00:03:02.124
30th sense: "Enemies in the Same Boat!
Safecracking is Systematic"
Geez! BABEL sure likes to keep us
running around on errands, huh?

00:03:02.124 --> 00:03:03.114
Geez! BABEL sure likes to keep us
running around on errands, huh?

00:03:03.454 --> 00:03:07.224
Don't be that way.
Here, I have presents for you all.

00:03:07.724 --> 00:03:08.524
What?! What?!

00:03:08.524 --> 00:03:09.194
Something to eat?

00:03:09.194 --> 00:03:10.334
Something soft?

00:03:10.334 --> 00:03:11.764
Does it run on electricity?

00:03:11.764 --> 00:03:13.094
We can't wait!

00:03:14.764 --> 00:03:15.874
Limiters!

00:03:15.874 --> 00:03:18.104
Did you make these, Mr. Minamoto?

00:03:18.104 --> 00:03:19.474
Um, yeah.

00:03:19.544 --> 00:03:20.804
They're so cute!

00:03:20.804 --> 00:03:23.044
These ones don't just limit your powers.

00:03:23.044 --> 00:03:25.444
They're designed more as power ups.

00:03:26.444 --> 00:03:28.544
Power ups? At this point?

00:03:28.544 --> 00:03:31.884
We don't have a toy company
as our new sponsor, do we?

00:03:31.884 --> 00:03:34.414
If that's it, I wish mine had a card slot on it...

00:03:35.954 --> 00:03:37.924
Children shouldn't get wild ideas like that.

00:03:38.354 --> 00:03:41.564
We may be getting more
dangerous missions in the future.

00:03:41.564 --> 00:03:45.084
I figured these might help
a little to keep you safe.

00:03:45.904 --> 00:03:47.524
Minamoto!

00:03:48.434 --> 00:03:53.134
That's right. No matter what,
I won't let you become devils!

00:03:54.004 --> 00:03:59.814
Welcome! This is our bank's
deepest underground vault!

00:04:05.054 --> 00:04:07.154
It... It's a mountain of treasure!

00:04:07.154 --> 00:04:10.054
We can buy people hearts
by the gram with all this!

00:04:10.054 --> 00:04:12.354
Quit getting so shamefully excited!

00:04:12.354 --> 00:04:15.324
I can see how there's a chance
they could turn evil.

00:04:15.794 --> 00:04:17.664
Okay, stand by!

00:04:17.664 --> 00:04:19.764
The Children, released!

00:04:19.764 --> 00:04:20.254
<<RELEASED>>
The Children, released!

00:04:22.604 --> 00:04:26.904
Changing, but unchanging!
The invincible espers!

00:04:27.574 --> 00:04:32.304
Where? Where? Where do we come from?!
BABEL, of course!

00:04:34.044 --> 00:04:37.654
Let's go! Heroes who protect
with the power of gold!

00:04:37.654 --> 00:04:38.784
Just call us...

00:04:38.784 --> 00:04:40.984
The Absolutely Lovely Children!

00:04:42.654 --> 00:04:44.084
Okay, quit playing around!

00:04:44.394 --> 00:04:48.094
Wow! Nobody would know if
we took two or three coins.

00:04:48.094 --> 00:04:49.994
Gold juggling!

00:04:49.994 --> 00:04:53.934
The owners of this one have been dying,
one after another. So pretty!

00:04:53.934 --> 00:04:57.094
Sorry, but having them come
makes this seem more dangerous.

00:04:57.404 --> 00:04:58.704
No, it's okay.

00:04:58.704 --> 00:05:01.034
Despite appearances,
they take their work seriously.

00:05:01.104 --> 00:05:02.474
That's not what I meant.

00:05:06.744 --> 00:05:09.044
Next, the gold lady...

00:05:10.754 --> 00:05:11.844
Huh?

00:05:12.284 --> 00:05:15.454
The security at our bank is world-class.

00:05:15.454 --> 00:05:17.894
Our ESP countermeasures are perfect!

00:05:17.894 --> 00:05:18.984
ECM, right?

00:05:19.224 --> 00:05:22.794
But if the enemy has an ECCM
device to counteract it...

00:05:22.794 --> 00:05:24.054
Impossible.

00:05:24.534 --> 00:05:27.234
The walls and floor of this
vault are all constructed of

00:05:27.234 --> 00:05:29.564
materials with unique
electromagnetic properties.

00:05:29.704 --> 00:05:31.374
They're also two meters thick.

00:05:31.374 --> 00:05:33.974
Even the world's most powerful
esper couldn't penetrate it.

00:05:33.974 --> 00:05:36.474
Your anti-esper defenses are amazing, but...

00:05:36.474 --> 00:05:38.714
But what if you're dealing
with a team of espers?

00:05:38.714 --> 00:05:39.514
What?

00:05:39.514 --> 00:05:43.444
There's a chance they could if
several of them worked together.

00:05:44.854 --> 00:05:46.254
Impossible!

00:05:47.054 --> 00:05:48.714
No. Possible.

00:05:49.054 --> 00:05:51.184
Big Magnum!

00:05:52.124 --> 00:05:54.464
The floor! What's?!

00:05:54.464 --> 00:05:56.454
Ooh! Here I come!

00:05:56.694 --> 00:06:00.034
BIG MAGNUM!

00:06:03.474 --> 00:06:06.874
Whoospy-daisy!

00:06:07.704 --> 00:06:08.504
That's!

00:06:09.744 --> 00:06:12.844
Aw! It's those girls from BABEL!

00:06:12.844 --> 00:06:14.604
Muscle and Mio from PANDRA!

00:06:15.144 --> 00:06:16.884
What are you doing here?!

00:06:16.884 --> 00:06:19.444
Looks like they predicted this.

00:06:20.054 --> 00:06:21.914
Outta here! Outta here!

00:06:22.954 --> 00:06:25.324
ECCM? That means!

00:06:25.324 --> 00:06:26.914
We can use our powers, too!

00:06:27.224 --> 00:06:29.364
Don't let them escape! Capture them!

00:06:29.364 --> 00:06:30.364
Roger!

00:06:30.364 --> 00:06:31.354
Let's go!

00:06:34.934 --> 00:06:37.874
Why, you! Give that back!

00:06:40.744 --> 00:06:44.174
Nice one, Mio! BIG MAGN...

00:06:44.174 --> 00:06:45.344
No, you don't!

00:06:45.344 --> 00:06:48.614
PSYCHIC GOLD RUSH!

00:06:51.814 --> 00:06:56.114
The pain of the classic gold
in the nuts attack returns!

00:06:56.454 --> 00:06:58.554
My bullets will hit you!

00:07:02.994 --> 00:07:05.624
Tan-tan-tanuki no!

00:07:07.034 --> 00:07:08.094
Damn!

00:07:08.464 --> 00:07:11.634
But if we can't use our powers, neither can you!

00:07:11.634 --> 00:07:13.074
We're not finished yet!

00:07:13.904 --> 00:07:15.874
Of all the lousy luck!

00:07:16.374 --> 00:07:17.844
Sore loser.

00:07:17.844 --> 00:07:21.014
You're still doing this?!
Or did Hyobu order you to?!

00:07:21.014 --> 00:07:23.314
No! The major isn't involved!

00:07:25.114 --> 00:07:27.244
If you want spending money, you need to earn it!

00:07:27.584 --> 00:07:30.984
See? It's the major's education policy!

00:07:31.124 --> 00:07:33.184
So he's totally involved!

00:07:33.394 --> 00:07:37.454
Nothing good will come of hanging
around with that lolicon criminal!

00:07:38.064 --> 00:07:41.094
What about you and your darling Children?

00:07:43.374 --> 00:07:45.534
This treasure just happened to end up here!

00:07:45.534 --> 00:07:46.344
Nice!

00:07:46.344 --> 00:07:48.774
Someone would think you're a
big-boobed beauty at first glance!

00:07:48.774 --> 00:07:49.974
No, they wouldn't.

00:07:49.974 --> 00:07:51.234
Think so?

00:07:51.344 --> 00:07:52.274
HEY!

00:07:52.274 --> 00:07:53.244
What?

00:07:53.244 --> 00:07:54.904
Anyway, let's take them back to HQ.

00:07:54.984 --> 00:07:56.774
Ooh! How forceful!

00:08:02.994 --> 00:08:04.014
It's shut.

00:08:04.824 --> 00:08:07.554
Security room! Open the vault!
Can't you hear me?!

00:08:09.094 --> 00:08:10.964
I hear you, Manager.

00:08:10.964 --> 00:08:13.334
Is that Nakamura, the teller?

00:08:13.334 --> 00:08:15.304
Why? Why are you doing this?

00:08:15.304 --> 00:08:17.534
We're everywhere.

00:08:17.534 --> 00:08:19.564
Do you understand now?

00:08:20.474 --> 00:08:23.944
You're with that anti-esper
group, the Normal People!

00:08:23.944 --> 00:08:25.464
Exactly.

00:08:25.914 --> 00:08:30.044
We're members who normally
just work at this bank!

00:08:30.384 --> 00:08:32.754
It can't be! Next month
you were going to marry

00:08:32.754 --> 00:08:35.184
your coworker Tanaka,
whom I fixed you up with!

00:08:35.184 --> 00:08:36.454
SO normal...

00:08:36.454 --> 00:08:41.664
Yes, but this is a chance to
kill 5 high-level espers!

00:08:41.664 --> 00:08:42.394
Minor sacrifices can't be helped
if it's for the sake of humanity!

00:08:42.394 --> 00:08:44.464
MINOR SACRIFICES
Minor sacrifices can't be helped
if it's for the sake of humanity!

00:08:44.464 --> 00:08:45.734
MINOR SACRIFICES
Minor?!

00:08:45.734 --> 00:08:45.934
MINOR SACRIFICES

00:08:45.934 --> 00:08:45.964
MINOR SACRIFICES
What kind of bull are you selling, lady?!

00:08:45.964 --> 00:08:47.664
What kind of bull are you selling, lady?!

00:08:47.664 --> 00:08:48.994
Open up, you jerk!

00:08:49.874 --> 00:08:52.604
I'm sorry. The bank is closed for today.

00:08:53.304 --> 00:08:54.904
It's not 3 o'clock yet!

00:08:54.904 --> 00:08:56.344
Can we communicate with the outside?

00:08:56.344 --> 00:08:58.034
Everything's been cut!

00:08:58.214 --> 00:09:01.244
We're fine. BABEL 3 is right outside.

00:09:01.244 --> 00:09:02.784
He'll figure out something's up.

00:09:02.784 --> 00:09:03.754
I hope, but...

00:09:04.054 --> 00:09:05.154
Minamoto said that?

00:09:05.154 --> 00:09:06.384
Yes. He said it's dangerous,

00:09:06.384 --> 00:09:08.714
so don't disturb them till
they've taken care of things.

00:09:09.324 --> 00:09:11.154
By the way, this tea's delicious.
An exquisite blend!

00:09:11.154 --> 00:09:13.024
Oh, I just wrung it out of my dust cloth...

00:09:13.024 --> 00:09:15.014
I mean, it's just normal tea.

00:09:15.224 --> 00:09:16.754
This can't be happening!

00:09:17.034 --> 00:09:20.324
If they want to finish us off,
there's a ton of ways to do it in here!

00:09:22.004 --> 00:09:23.794
The ventilator!

00:09:23.874 --> 00:09:26.844
Eek! They're going to suck all the air out of here!

00:09:26.844 --> 00:09:27.704
Mr. Minamoto!

00:09:27.704 --> 00:09:30.734
We can't use our powers here!

00:09:31.114 --> 00:09:33.734
What's the problem if they
suck all the air out of here?

00:09:33.914 --> 00:09:36.884
Um, we won't be able to breathe?

00:09:38.654 --> 00:09:39.744
Agh! We'll die!

00:09:39.924 --> 00:09:42.454
God, you're slow! Are you stupid?!

00:09:42.454 --> 00:09:45.954
Shut up! You are the last person
to be saying stuff like that!

00:09:45.954 --> 00:09:49.654
What?! A stupid person calling people
stupid is... Stupid! Stupid! Stupid!

00:09:49.764 --> 00:09:50.864
Would you quit it?

00:09:50.864 --> 00:09:54.024
Yes. Fellow idiots shouldn't argue.

00:09:55.504 --> 00:09:58.034
Look, how about a temporary truce?

00:09:58.034 --> 00:10:00.374
We don't have much time before the air runs out.

00:10:01.444 --> 00:10:03.244
That's true.

00:10:03.244 --> 00:10:05.234
But can we trust these people from PANDRA?

00:10:05.544 --> 00:10:08.784
Oh, there's no reason to hesitate!

00:10:08.784 --> 00:10:10.614
I tell you, I love you!

00:10:12.924 --> 00:10:15.724
Why, you! You! You!

00:10:15.724 --> 00:10:16.714
What are they doing?

00:10:16.794 --> 00:10:18.024
Kaoru, step aside.

00:10:18.024 --> 00:10:18.994
I'm going to kill him.

00:10:18.994 --> 00:10:20.194
Good! Do it!

00:10:20.194 --> 00:10:22.294
Wait! Calm down!

00:10:22.294 --> 00:10:24.434
Look, our problem is the ECM!

00:10:24.434 --> 00:10:27.194
Without them, we could use our powers, right?!

00:10:27.834 --> 00:10:28.934
That's right!

00:10:28.934 --> 00:10:29.404
Wait!

00:10:30.834 --> 00:10:32.704
YOU LOSE

00:10:32.704 --> 00:10:34.174
YOU LOSE
It's fake!

00:10:34.474 --> 00:10:36.744
Right. Half of them are dummies.

00:10:36.744 --> 00:10:37.914
Then if I shoot them all!

00:10:37.914 --> 00:10:40.214
No! There are several real ones,

00:10:40.214 --> 00:10:44.144
but inside they have charges
to blow up the entire vault!

00:10:49.554 --> 00:10:50.554
Right...

00:10:50.554 --> 00:10:54.324
Without my powers, my aim's gotten bad, too.

00:10:54.324 --> 00:10:55.984
We're saved!

00:10:56.494 --> 00:10:59.034
Still, this is just a question of time.

00:10:59.034 --> 00:11:02.624
If we don't do something...
we're really going to die!

00:11:03.474 --> 00:11:05.164
No. C'mon, think!

00:11:06.034 --> 00:11:07.974
There must be a way.

00:11:08.804 --> 00:11:10.074
Minamoto.

00:11:10.344 --> 00:11:12.814
Hold me! As my last memory!

00:11:12.814 --> 00:11:14.574
Where did you learn lines like that?!

00:11:15.314 --> 00:11:17.474
Hold me! As my last memory!

00:11:18.514 --> 00:11:22.474
So many of these Korean dramas came
out while I was asleep for 10 years!

00:11:23.094 --> 00:11:24.144
So touching!

00:11:24.224 --> 00:11:25.624
We will continue, after these messages.

00:11:28.194 --> 00:11:28.924
Why, you!

00:11:28.924 --> 00:11:30.484
I've got a bad feeling about this!

00:11:33.764 --> 00:11:35.634
Because I'm not very useful.

00:11:41.744 --> 00:11:43.364
Hmph! What's with the princess act?

00:11:43.674 --> 00:11:44.644
Me, next!

00:11:44.644 --> 00:11:45.644
Me, too! Me, too!

00:11:45.644 --> 00:11:47.584
Get one of me, too! Hug me!

00:11:47.584 --> 00:11:50.344
Why are they fooling around?!
We're running out of oxygen!

00:11:52.184 --> 00:11:53.204
That might work!

00:11:57.594 --> 00:11:58.684
Good!

00:11:58.954 --> 00:12:01.354
The only thing damaged is the power unit!

00:12:01.424 --> 00:12:02.414
I can fix it soon with this!

00:12:02.794 --> 00:12:05.734
Everyone, give me your cell phones!
I'll put their batteries in this!

00:12:07.404 --> 00:12:10.734
All we need is for the ECCM
to work for 5 or 10 seconds.

00:12:10.734 --> 00:12:12.534
But, is that enough time?

00:12:12.604 --> 00:12:14.204
We have to try!

00:12:14.204 --> 00:12:16.534
Now, lie flat to protect your
brain from oxygen starvation!

00:12:28.754 --> 00:12:31.854
Won't Mr. Hyobu come to save you?

00:12:31.854 --> 00:12:35.524
He won't. No one knows we came here.

00:12:36.494 --> 00:12:37.394
Yeah.

00:12:37.794 --> 00:12:41.324
And even if he did come,
it wouldn't be for my sake.

00:12:41.864 --> 00:12:43.394
Why is it always for her?

00:12:43.634 --> 00:12:45.194
That's not true.

00:12:46.374 --> 00:12:48.804
You're very precious to the major.

00:12:49.674 --> 00:12:50.574
Muscle...

00:12:50.814 --> 00:12:51.864
After all...

00:12:52.214 --> 00:12:54.974
Don't you see he's come here for you?

00:12:55.044 --> 00:12:58.684
There are itty-bitty majors everywhere!
And a flower garden over there!

00:12:58.684 --> 00:13:01.654
Hurry! Muscle's starting to hallucinate!

00:13:01.654 --> 00:13:03.684
Hang on! Got it!

00:13:05.594 --> 00:13:07.114
Well, Kaoru?!

00:13:12.234 --> 00:13:16.604
It's working! My power is back!

00:13:25.474 --> 00:13:28.204
The electromagnetic walls!
The material's absorbing your psychic power!

00:13:28.414 --> 00:13:30.584
How did you guys get through it?

00:13:30.584 --> 00:13:32.914
Well, we couldn't break through in one try,

00:13:32.984 --> 00:13:35.924
so we broke through bit by bit by
changing it to a different metal.

00:13:36.184 --> 00:13:39.054
No time for that! What do we do, Minamoto?!

00:13:39.054 --> 00:13:41.284
Use the new boosters I made!

00:13:42.794 --> 00:13:45.194
Psychokinesis is the simplest psychic waveform.

00:13:45.534 --> 00:13:47.564
It's technically possible to electronically add

00:13:47.564 --> 00:13:49.154
the power of two others to your own!

00:13:51.934 --> 00:13:54.904
Okay, Kaoru! Take our power!

00:13:58.544 --> 00:14:01.514
The power... It's flowing into me!

00:14:02.284 --> 00:14:04.514
Incredible! In that case!

00:14:04.814 --> 00:14:08.684
The Children, Triple Boost, Full Release!

00:14:08.684 --> 00:14:09.054
< < FULL RELEASE> >
The Children, Triple Boost, Full Release!

00:14:11.794 --> 00:14:13.464
FULL RELEASE!!

00:14:13.464 --> 00:14:13.624
FULL RELEASE!!
GO!

00:14:13.624 --> 00:14:16.754
GO!

00:14:19.804 --> 00:14:23.064
This is the power of a Level 7!

00:14:28.304 --> 00:14:29.004
Mio?

00:14:29.004 --> 00:14:31.304
I... I'm also a teleporter, so...

00:14:31.974 --> 00:14:33.774
I can mix my power in too, can't I?

00:14:34.544 --> 00:14:36.184
Maybe she's not totally stupid.

00:14:36.184 --> 00:14:36.684
Maybe.

00:14:36.684 --> 00:14:37.844
Shut up!

00:14:38.484 --> 00:14:41.214
It's boring getting saved by you guys all the time!

00:14:41.924 --> 00:14:45.954
Let's show the Normal People what espers
can do when they combine their powers!

00:14:45.954 --> 00:14:46.924
Yeah!

00:14:51.264 --> 00:14:52.924
The tea snacks are excellent, too...
You're not normal!

00:14:53.264 --> 00:14:57.394
PSYCHIC GREAT ESCAPE!

00:15:06.174 --> 00:15:07.944
What an amazing sight!

00:15:07.944 --> 00:15:10.354
The technique has opened a hole in the thick

00:15:10.354 --> 00:15:13.584
and massive outer walls, thrown
open in a massive crater...

00:15:13.584 --> 00:15:15.144
Why not just say "it's broken"?

00:15:15.784 --> 00:15:18.694
Well, if they hadn't done it...

00:15:18.794 --> 00:15:22.224
I know. Thanks to this, we all escaped death.

00:15:24.694 --> 00:15:27.694
Your espers really are sweet girls, aren't they?

00:15:28.304 --> 00:15:30.834
They may possess terrifying power,

00:15:30.834 --> 00:15:34.364
but I can't imagine ever
thinking I'd prefer them dead.

00:15:34.874 --> 00:15:36.064
Manager...

00:15:36.574 --> 00:15:39.974
Make sure they learn to use that power wisely.

00:15:40.414 --> 00:15:44.714
Don't worry, sir. That's what BABEL's
here for. What I'M here for!

00:15:46.054 --> 00:15:47.954
S-Something's coming!

00:15:47.954 --> 00:15:49.474
No, Kaoru! That's!

00:15:49.894 --> 00:15:50.324
BONK!

00:15:51.124 --> 00:15:53.094
That's... the gold.

00:15:55.724 --> 00:15:56.564
Why, you...

00:15:56.564 --> 00:15:56.794
BONK!
Why, you...

00:15:58.094 --> 00:15:59.494
What's wrong?!

00:15:59.934 --> 00:16:02.934
Uh-oh! The boost put too much
strain on Kaoru's body!

00:16:02.934 --> 00:16:04.464
She won't be able to use her powers for a while!

00:16:05.234 --> 00:16:07.274
You could've mentioned that sooner!

00:16:07.274 --> 00:16:08.804
Uh-oh! Teleport!

00:16:08.804 --> 00:16:09.404
Mio!

00:16:09.404 --> 00:16:10.844
All right!

00:16:11.314 --> 00:16:12.714
So, how's it been lately?

00:16:12.714 --> 00:16:14.144
Good enough, but...

00:16:16.144 --> 00:16:17.304
GOLD!

00:16:17.914 --> 00:16:19.254
And also...

00:16:19.254 --> 00:16:21.654
It's snowing money!

00:16:22.954 --> 00:16:24.694
Gimme! Gimme! Gimme!

00:16:24.694 --> 00:16:26.454
But, we're...

00:16:26.454 --> 00:16:27.794
public servants.

00:16:33.094 --> 00:16:34.764
Don't take it! That wealth belongs in my bank!

00:16:34.834 --> 00:16:37.164
This might cause worse
damage than the robbery.

00:16:37.374 --> 00:16:38.464
Um, Aoi?

00:16:38.674 --> 00:16:41.234
I've gotta do this? What a pain...

00:16:42.074 --> 00:16:43.804
It's Mio and Muscle?

00:16:43.874 --> 00:16:47.104
Buh-bye, my BABEL friends!

00:16:47.184 --> 00:16:49.444
Darn it. That's all we get, in the end?

00:16:50.184 --> 00:16:50.804
Mio.

00:16:51.454 --> 00:16:54.884
Tell the queen. Next time, for sure.

00:16:56.184 --> 00:16:57.894
Did lamebrain leave?

00:16:57.894 --> 00:16:59.114
Hm? Yeah.

00:16:59.424 --> 00:17:02.894
Is being with Mr. Hyobu really that great?

00:17:02.894 --> 00:17:03.834
Kaoru.

00:17:03.834 --> 00:17:08.334
Okay, he's cooler than you and
stronger and more generous...

00:17:08.334 --> 00:17:11.034
Hey! Is that a problem?!

00:17:11.034 --> 00:17:13.564
Bad enough you're comparing
me to that pervert!

00:17:13.774 --> 00:17:17.864
But I feel safer being near you, Minamoto.

00:17:18.514 --> 00:17:21.784
As long as we're with a
goody two-shoes like you,

00:17:21.784 --> 00:17:23.444
we can be good girls.

00:17:23.754 --> 00:17:26.614
No fair hogging him while other
people do all the work!

00:17:26.614 --> 00:17:27.644
Outrage!

00:17:27.754 --> 00:17:29.654
Kaoru, give me a turn with him!

00:17:29.654 --> 00:17:31.124
No way!

00:17:36.164 --> 00:17:39.064
Being good isn't always the
same as being right, Queen.

00:17:39.234 --> 00:17:42.604
That gentleness will only serve
you while you're still a child.

00:17:42.604 --> 00:17:46.264
You'll come to me eventually. Right, Koremitsu?

00:17:47.444 --> 00:17:49.344
Release us, you monsters!

00:17:49.344 --> 00:17:52.174
I wanted a normal wedding! Kill us normally!

00:17:53.414 --> 00:17:57.284
Afraid not. For you, this will be
so much more amusing.

00:17:57.284 --> 00:18:00.884
Shall we go? I'm sure the senior staff
will be complaining about something.

00:18:00.884 --> 00:18:03.524
Didn't you come because you were worried
about this being Mio's first job?

00:18:03.524 --> 00:18:04.614
We should go back together.

00:18:04.694 --> 00:18:07.214
It was a secret, you idiot. Especially from her!

00:18:08.594 --> 00:18:09.784
Major...

00:18:12.034 --> 00:18:13.194
Hold it.

00:18:15.964 --> 00:18:19.264
You're a little slow in making
your escape, Kyosuke Hyobu!

00:18:19.634 --> 00:18:21.644
Fujiko! It's been too long.

00:18:21.644 --> 00:18:25.094
How did you know I was here?
Your usual feminine intuition, perhaps?

00:18:26.214 --> 00:18:27.744
That may have helped.

00:18:27.744 --> 00:18:30.054
I also have a proximity alarm that detects

00:18:30.054 --> 00:18:32.854
when you approach Minamoto and The Children.

00:18:32.854 --> 00:18:34.784
Hyobu! Hyobu! Hyobu's come!

00:18:35.284 --> 00:18:36.684
I'm taking you in.

00:18:37.194 --> 00:18:39.754
Do you have any intention
of coming along quietly?!

00:18:40.024 --> 00:18:42.114
None. I've had it with that.

00:18:42.594 --> 00:18:45.254
Unlike ten years ago, there's a lot I want to do.

00:18:46.464 --> 00:18:48.334
Koremitsu, can you get back on your own?

00:18:48.334 --> 00:18:49.004
Sir!

00:18:49.004 --> 00:18:51.234
I saw Igo's vision.

00:18:51.804 --> 00:18:54.234
I thought you'd be thinking the same thing I am!

00:18:54.474 --> 00:18:56.204
To want to save those girls!

00:18:56.304 --> 00:18:57.904
You're wrong.

00:18:59.014 --> 00:19:02.144
The happy ending you desire
isn't possible in reality.

00:19:03.214 --> 00:19:07.844
You want what cannot be done.
That goes for the kid, too.

00:19:09.184 --> 00:19:11.184
Which is why that tragedy will occur.

00:19:14.324 --> 00:19:17.884
You should hurry up and figure
that out, for everyone's sake.

00:19:18.334 --> 00:19:19.834
Enough, already!

00:19:19.834 --> 00:19:21.734
Are you giving me the same tired,
decades-old argument?

00:19:22.364 --> 00:19:24.834
Minamoto isn't like that man!

00:19:26.074 --> 00:19:27.974
Kaoru isn't like you!

00:19:28.044 --> 00:19:30.204
No. She's the same!

00:19:33.844 --> 00:19:35.944
I said she's not, you little punk!

00:19:36.014 --> 00:19:37.784
Why don't you grow up?!

00:19:37.784 --> 00:19:39.584
You're hardly one to talk!

00:19:39.584 --> 00:19:41.354
That's it! I get it!

00:19:41.354 --> 00:19:44.624
This ends, here! I'm finishing this!

00:19:44.624 --> 00:19:46.054
Kyosuke, be careful!

00:19:46.054 --> 00:19:47.354
No backseat driving.

00:19:47.994 --> 00:19:49.894
This is a more powerful attack than last time.

00:19:49.894 --> 00:19:51.424
Impressive as always, Fujiko.

00:19:51.734 --> 00:19:52.624
However...

00:19:56.504 --> 00:19:57.374
However...

00:19:57.374 --> 00:19:59.874
I've been continuously fighting in
secret for the last ten years!

00:19:59.874 --> 00:20:00.844
You are no match!

00:20:05.014 --> 00:20:06.774
Goodbye, big sister.

00:20:09.144 --> 00:20:10.274
Damn!

00:20:12.154 --> 00:20:13.244
I have you!

00:20:21.094 --> 00:20:23.564
He's not moving as fast. I can get him now!

00:20:25.094 --> 00:20:27.034
Cut it out. If you want energy,

00:20:27.104 --> 00:20:30.004
better to absorb it from someone
younger, right? You're too greedy!

00:20:30.274 --> 00:20:31.164
Shut up.

00:20:42.714 --> 00:20:44.144
You shouldn't do this, Major.

00:20:44.484 --> 00:20:47.244
That's right. You're our boss.

00:20:47.684 --> 00:20:50.214
Why not consider your position
a little and not be so rash?

00:20:52.224 --> 00:20:56.664
Word of warning, lady from BABEL: the
major's changed over the last ten years.

00:20:57.064 --> 00:20:59.194
We won't stand idly by if you move against him.

00:20:59.564 --> 00:21:01.504
Hyobu's comrades?!

00:21:01.834 --> 00:21:03.854
Honestly, I was doing fine.

00:21:03.934 --> 00:21:05.874
Right, 'cuz I was with him!

00:21:05.934 --> 00:21:07.274
Where was that?

00:21:08.374 --> 00:21:10.574
And what use is a little shrimp like you?

00:21:10.574 --> 00:21:12.674
What was that?! You'll die for that!

00:21:13.244 --> 00:21:16.344
You were all small when I first gathered you.

00:21:17.354 --> 00:21:19.914
Um, please leave that talk for later.

00:21:21.184 --> 00:21:23.174
So long, you saggy-boobed granny.

00:21:24.054 --> 00:21:27.794
Size isn't everything for a woman.
Shape matters, too. And color.

00:21:27.794 --> 00:21:29.814
Sorry, Fujiko. Until next time.

00:21:32.134 --> 00:21:34.294
Shit! I'll remember all of your faces!

00:21:34.664 --> 00:21:37.104
You want what cannot be done.

00:21:37.934 --> 00:21:41.464
No! Minamoto's the man who can pull it off!

00:21:41.874 --> 00:21:44.244
It's love that saves the past and future.

00:21:44.244 --> 00:21:45.644
And even you!

00:21:45.974 --> 00:21:48.004
And why'd he have to drag color in it?!

00:21:50.184 --> 00:21:52.704
I can't? You can't just buy things with gold?

00:21:52.784 --> 00:21:54.684
After what I did to steal... Er, borrow it!

00:21:54.684 --> 00:21:56.124
Can't I even get potato chips for it?!
Potato chips?!

00:21:56.624 --> 00:21:59.254
And then the guy at the
store was really nice to me!

00:21:59.254 --> 00:21:59.994
Oh?

00:21:59.994 --> 00:22:03.154
He made an exception and gave me all
these potato chips for all the gold!

00:22:04.234 --> 00:22:06.064
Where?! Where was that convenience store?!

00:22:06.064 --> 00:22:06.864
I forgot.

00:22:06.864 --> 00:22:09.694
Then start remembering, potato chip girl!

00:22:21.414 --> 00:22:26.114
Kimi no tsuyogari wo gyuuto dakishimeta

00:22:26.114 --> 00:22:29.054
Setsunai yokogao sae zenbu

00:22:29.054 --> 00:22:31.424
I-TO-SHI-I

00:22:31.424 --> 00:22:35.624
Kabe wo kowasu tabi tsuyokunaru onna yo

00:22:35.624 --> 00:22:41.494
Boku no hitomi ni kurui wa nai

00:22:41.834 --> 00:22:46.804
Massugu sugiru mune no omoi

00:22:46.804 --> 00:22:50.374
Darenimo makenai kara

00:22:50.374 --> 00:22:55.614
Zettai kimi wo hanasanai donna toki mo

00:22:55.614 --> 00:23:00.824
Mada mienai LAST wa boku ga kaeyou

00:23:00.824 --> 00:23:05.154
Akuma mo tenshi nimo tsubasa ga aru

00:23:05.154 --> 00:23:10.794
Motto takai sora e to michibikou

00:23:10.794 --> 00:23:15.504
Kore ijou egao wo kumorasenai

00:23:15.504 --> 00:23:21.874
Tsunagaru kibou ga ima yami wo hikisaitara

00:23:21.874 --> 00:23:24.804
Kimi to tomo ni

00:23:25.044 --> 00:23:30.674
Tobikoeru ashita e Break Your Destiny

00:23:41.024 --> 00:23:41.524
NEXT EPISODE

00:23:41.524 --> 00:23:41.964
NEXT EPISODE
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:41.964 --> 00:23:43.364
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:43.794 --> 00:23:45.434
Today, I have Mr. Minamoto all to myself!

00:23:45.434 --> 00:23:47.634
I hardly ever get to go to my home
town with just the two of us.

00:23:47.634 --> 00:23:48.934
Just the two of us? You're wrong there.

00:23:48.934 --> 00:23:50.804
Oh! Sorry for the wait!

00:23:50.804 --> 00:23:52.934
What are you doing here?!
You're totally in the way!

00:23:52.934 --> 00:23:55.374
I'm going to Kyoto too, for my own mission!

00:23:55.374 --> 00:23:56.974
Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:56.974 --> 00:23:59.974
Episode 31: "World Heritage!
C'mon, Shall We Go To Kyoto?"

00:23:59.974 --> 00:24:01.784
It's a lovely town, isn't it?

00:24:01.784 --> 00:24:05.214
But I can make it so much
lovelier, don't you think?

00:24:05.214 --> 00:24:06.654
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:06.654 --> 00:24:07.254
World Heritage!
C'mon, Shall We Go To Kyoto?
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:07.254 --> 00:24:09.944
World Heritage!
C'mon, Shall We Go To Kyoto?
